---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Strategic communications and advisory"
  description="Communications strategy, content and digital strategy for space, Earth observation, climate and sustainability organisations, delivered through Green Orbit Digital."
>
  <div class="wrap page">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/work-with-me/">Work with me</a> / Consulting</nav>
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Strategic communications and advisory</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        I help organisations explain complex science, technology and sustainability work to the people who need to
        understand it, with a clear strategy behind the words.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Who this is for</h2>
      <ul class="plain-list">
        <li>Space and Earth observation organisations</li>
        <li>Climate, sustainability and environmental organisations</li>
        <li>Science and technology businesses</li>
        <li>Mission-led and public-interest initiatives</li>
        <li>Any organisation communicating technical, scientific or policy-heavy subject matter</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>What I can help with</h2>
      <ul class="plain-list">
        <li><strong>Positioning and narrative:</strong> what you do, for whom, and why it matters, stated plainly.</li>
        <li><strong>Editorial and content strategy:</strong> what to publish, for which audience, and how it connects.</li>
        <li><strong>Digital strategy:</strong> website structure, search, content architecture and measurement.</li>
        <li><strong>Science and sustainability communication:</strong> research-led messaging that holds up to expert scrutiny.</li>
        <li><strong>Stakeholder engagement:</strong> understanding and mapping the audiences you need to reach.</li>
        <li><strong>Workshops and capability building:</strong> helping your team write and plan for itself.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Individual advice or an organisation project?</h2>
      <div class="note">
        <p>
          <strong>Organisation-level projects</strong> (retained support, multi-part strategies, delivery by a team) are
          handled by <a href="https://greenorbit.space">Green Orbit Digital</a>, the practice I founded and direct.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top:.75rem">
          <strong>Short, individual pieces of advice</strong>, such as a review of a communications plan, a speaking
          slot or a workshop, can be arranged with me directly. Tell me what you need and I’ll point you to the right
          route.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>How an engagement starts</h2>
      <p class="prose">
        Send a short description of the organisation, what you’re trying to achieve and your timescale. I’ll reply with
        questions or a suggested next step. Scope and fees are agreed in writing before any work begins.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="bp" href="/contact/#communications">Discuss a communications project</a>
        <a class="bo" href="/projects/">See selected projects</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
